 From left: Former President Joe Biden, former First Lady Laura Bush, former President George W. Bush, former New York Mayor Michael Bloomberg, and Vice President JD Vance attend a 9/11 memorial event in Manhattan today. Photo: Angela Weiss/AFP via Getty Images 🕯️ In Manhattan, Terry Strada, who lost her husband, Tom Strada, on 9/11, used the annual reading of the names of those killed to plead with the Trump administration to confront Saudi Arabia about alleged ties to the terror attack, which the kingdom has denied . Keep reading . 🦠 The CDC declared the cyclospora outbreak related to Taylor Farms' lettuce to be over, though the FDA says its investigation remains ongoing. Go deeper . 🏛️ A letter circulating among House members urges Speaker Mike Johnson (R-La.) to bring the House back "immediately" and keep it in session until lawmakers pass AI safeguards, Axios' Andrew Solender has learned. Go deeper. 
 
